Z||000000||Bizquik||11-14-2001||11:07 AM||||Well, I have a 5-spd and I've heard there are those two types, but which is the one in my car, or how can i tell? thx<P>Jon||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||11-14-2001||12:13 PM||||Isuzu. Getrag only with V6's.||||reg||1
Z||000002||watts||11-14-2001||12:58 PM||||And to be sure (well, pretty much) - the Getrag's have a dipstick, the Isuzu's don't.<P>And yeah yeah yeah...  there were exceptions to that rule, but lets not confuse the issue.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Oh yeah, the Getrag's also only have one shift cable that comes down from the top (the other one comes more at an upward angle from down lower).<P>But anyhow - chances are that it's the Isuzu.<BR><P>------------------<BR>87/88 V6 5spd Notchback Hybrid<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/watts_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
