Z||000004||GSXPete||11-14-2001||10:42 PM||||is the getrag the best tranny? someone mentioned which one was better, but i forget.<P>also, what comes in a n 87 v6 5spd? getrag? ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Raydar||11-14-2001||10:49 PM||||All V-6 5 speeds were Getrags from the factory. All 4 cyl 5 speeds were Isuzus from the factory. <BR>The Getrag is stronger, but many folks are using the Isuzu behind (beside?) 350 V-8 conversions and 3.4s with no ill effects. <BR>The weak part of the Isuzu is supposed to be the shift fork. If you don't speed shift it, you should be okay.<BR>Aside from that, Getrags are waaaay expensive. Isuzus are fairly cheap and plentiful, if you happen to scatter one. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
